INSERT INTO category_content (category_slug, section_order, subheading, paragraphs, created_at, updated_at) VALUES
('computers-tablets', 0, NULL, '["Choosing the right technology is essential for staying productive, entertained, and connected in everyday life. Whether you are looking for a reliable tablet computer for mobility, a powerful gaming computer for performance-intensive tasks, or planning to buy a personal computer for home or office use, the right device can make a significant difference. At Rouge Technologies, customers can find dependable computing solutions designed to support modern digital needs with efficiency, speed, and long-term reliability.","Computers and tablets play a central role in work, education, communication, and entertainment. From handling everyday tasks such as browsing and document creation to running demanding software and immersive games, selecting the right device ensures a smooth and enjoyable experience. By focusing on performance, usability, and flexibility, Rouge Technologies helps customers choose technology that fits their lifestyle and usage requirements."]', unixepoch(), unixepoch()),
('computers-tablets', 1, 'Tablet Computer Solutions for Everyday Use', '["A tablet computer is an excellent choice for users who value portability and convenience without compromising functionality. Modern tablet computer designs offer responsive touchscreens, strong processing capabilities, and extended battery life, making them suitable for a wide range of activities. From streaming content and reading to attending virtual meetings and managing daily tasks, a tablet computer provides a flexible solution that adapts to different environments.","Many users choose a tablet computer because it is lightweight and easy to carry, making it ideal for travel, commuting, or working from multiple locations. With support for accessories such as keyboards and styluses, a tablet computer can easily transition into a productivity-focused device. This versatility allows users to take notes, edit documents, and manage emails efficiently while still enjoying entertainment and creative applications.","A tablet computer is also a popular option for families and students, offering intuitive controls and quick access to educational tools and applications. With a balance of performance and ease of use, a tablet computer supports both casual and professional needs, making it a valuable addition to any digital setup."]', unixepoch(), unixepoch()),
('computers-tablets', 2, 'Gaming Computer Performance and Capability', '["A gaming computer is designed for users who require advanced performance, fast processing speeds, and high-quality graphics. Whether used for gaming, creative projects, or professional software, a gaming computer delivers the power needed to handle demanding applications smoothly. Equipped with strong processors, dedicated graphics solutions, and efficient cooling systems, a gaming computer ensures consistent performance during extended sessions.","Beyond gaming, a gaming computer is well suited for tasks such as video editing, 3D modelling, and software development. These systems are built to manage heavy workloads and multitasking with ease, making them a practical choice for power users. A gaming computer provides the responsiveness and stability required for both entertainment and productivity-focused applications.","Another advantage of a gaming computer is its ability to support upgrades. Many gaming computer systems allow components to be updated over time, extending the lifespan of the device and ensuring continued compatibility with new software and technology. This makes a gaming computer a long-term investment for users who want performance that evolves with their needs."]', unixepoch(), unixepoch()),
('computers-tablets', 3, 'Buy a Personal Computer that fits your needs', '["When you buy a personal computer, you are investing in a device that supports daily tasks such as work, study, communication, and online services. A personal computer remains an essential tool for home offices, remote learning, and everyday digital activities. Choosing to buy a personal computer that offers reliable performance and user-friendly features helps ensure a smooth computing experience.","Many customers choose to buy a personal computer for its stability and versatility. A well-designed personal computer can manage office applications, video calls, web browsing, and media playback efficiently. For families and professionals alike, buying the right personal computer supports productivity while offering a comfortable and dependable user experience.","When you buy a personal computer from Rouge Technologies, you gain access to systems selected for quality, durability, and performance. These computers are built to meet modern software requirements while maintaining consistent operation over time. Whether upgrading an existing setup or purchasing a new system, choosing to buy a personal computer that aligns with your needs ensures long-term value and satisfaction.","By offering flexible tablet computer solutions, high-performance gaming computer systems, and reliable options to buy personal computer devices, Rouge Technologies supports a wide range of users. Each device is designed to deliver efficiency, usability, and performance, helping customers stay connected, productive, and confident in their technology choices."]', unixepoch(), unixepoch()),
('laptops', 0, NULL, '["Whether you are looking for high-performance gaming, professional work capabilities, or a versatile device for everyday use, laptops offer the flexibility and power needed to handle all tasks efficiently. At Rouge Technologies, customers can explore a wide range of laptops designed to meet diverse needs, combining reliability, portability, and modern technology. Selecting the right laptop ensures productivity, entertainment, and convenience in one compact device."]', unixepoch(), unixepoch());
